# Cloudflare Pages / static host headers.
# COOP must be same-origin-allow-popups so Google GIS OAuth popups can return
# tokens (strict same-origin severs window.opener → popup_closed after account pick).
# Do NOT set Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy on HTML documents: require-corp blocks
# Google Picker's docs.google.com iframe (blank gray dialog). Keep CORP on
# Workers/WASM/ffmpeg assets below. FFmpeg uses single-thread when not isolated.
# worker-src 'self' blob: keeps FFmpeg class + core workers allowed under CSP.
# frame-ancestors 'self' + X-Frame-Options SAMEORIGIN allow same-origin iframes
# (Responsive Device Preview, tool modals) while blocking third-party embedding.
# Note: when paths overlap, the last matching rule wins (headers are not merged).

/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Content-Security-Policy: worker-src 'self' blob:; frame-ancestors 'self';

# Hashed Next.js build output — long-lived immutable cache
/_next/static/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/icons/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/images/*
